  "id": "recognition-method",
  "term": "recognition method",
  "definition": "A recognition method is a way of identifying human behavior from video data. In this source, it refers to a convolutional neural network approach that first isolates the body region and samples parts of a video so the system can focus on behavior-related information and improve classification accuracy.",
